.nh
.TH "PB-ENV-VAULT-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-env-vault-list - List the workspace's named ENV vaults


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb env vault list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the named vaults of the active workspace with their key epoch, value revision and
the recipes that read them. Values are never printed; pb env run shows them to a
command on a machine that may read them.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-env-vault(1)\fP
